{"title":"2003 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For every real number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/b/a5b29b358e825defa3e11b7d903d43ec31e5909a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b,c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"18\" />, prove the following inequality\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/b/42b98732c2bf6cdb894a7cfd0248b14a79a4753a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[5a^2 + 5b^2 + 5c^2 \\ge 4ab + 4bc + 4ca\\]\" width=\"265\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>and determine when the equality holds.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Trivial_Inequality\" title=\"Trivial Inequality\">Trivial Inequality</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/c/8dc57fd698a2e4a34a3780c8d481af89edb8b3ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a-2b)^2 \\ge 0,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"107\" height=\"19\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/f/72f6f1755fb7fcac3c68943c38dbebd0303b83f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(b-2c)^2 \\ge 0,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"106\" height=\"19\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/2/3a2178445e41734bd5e6006f02ba52099b83eed8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(c-2a)^2 \\ge 0.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"107\" height=\"19\" />  Adding all the equations, expanding the terms, and rearranging the resulting terms results in\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/3/b8352f585ee575e5bfb7c64babb86adf204c8d14.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} (a-2b)^2 + (b-2c)^2 + (c-2a)^2 &amp;\\ge 0 \\\\ a^2 - 4ab + 4b^2 + b^2 - 4bc + 4c^2 + c^2 - 4ac + 4a^2 &amp;\\ge 0 \\\\ 5a^2 + 5b^2 + 5c^2 &amp;\\ge 4ab + 4bc + 4ac \\end{align*}\" width=\"524\" height=\"73\" />\nEquality holds when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/1/ee190a8ae0b3c732b68f7eb232d2a9437458c778.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a-2b = b-2c = c-2a = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"228\" height=\"16\" />  When that happens, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/c/9ac37ec787028b09e094fabcb70c0bd7c75c7c93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 2b = 4c = 8a,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"138\" height=\"16\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/e/25ee7770e3d0415ffbe43d274a0d6461245083b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=b=c=0.$\" width=\"110\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/0/3f03923c445607ddf8b5628f9f060d542a3ff8b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5a^2 + 5b^2 + 5c^2 \\ge 4a^2 + 4b^2 + 4c^2 = 4ab + 4bc + 4ac+ 2(a-b)^2 + 2(b-c)^2 + 2(c-a)^2 \\ge 4ab + 4bc + 4ac$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"834\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>Equality holds when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/3/7d365fcd9d00b199eaabeb52cc6d6fa952a028b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2=b^2=c^2=0, a=b=c=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"246\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO\" title=\"2003 Indonesia MO\">2003 Indonesia MO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO_Problems\" title=\"2003 Indonesia MO Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2003 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2003 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2003 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2003 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2003 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2003 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2003 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2003 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 8\">8</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2003 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Indonesia_MO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"Indonesia MO Problems and Solutions\"> All Indonesia MO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017202517\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.019 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.035 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 97/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1044/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 52/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2261/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTranscl